   "source": [
    "# 52 · 研究Agent - 自主搜集资料 + 写综述\n",
    "\n",
    "> **项目目标**：做一个 Agent，给定研究话题（如「最近 3 个月 RAG 评估方面的进展」），它会自主搜资料、读文章、做笔记、写综述，并把过程沉淀为 Skill。\n",
    "\n",
    "> **预备**：02-Agent 全部 + 03-Skills 全部 + 05-评估 全部。\n",
    "\n",
    "> **为什么重要**：**研究型 Agent 是「外挂大脑」**。帮你节省每天 2-3 小时搜集资料的时间，团队人均周节约 X 小时。\n",
    "\n",
    "**核心能力**：\n",
    "- 自主规划：分解研究话题\n",
    "- 工具调用：web 搜索 / 网页读取 / 笔记存储\n",
    "- 失败恢复：checkpoint + 重试\n",
    "- 过程沉淀：轨迹 eval + Skill 化\n",
    "- 长期记忆：历史综述向量库"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "setup",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "MODE = 'OFFLINE'  # 'OFFLINE'（离线）或 'ONLINE'（在线）\n",
    "\n",
    "import json, hashlib, time\n",
    "from typing import List, Dict\n",
    "print(f'MODE = {MODE}')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "s1-md",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 1. Agent 架构设计\n",
    "\n",
    **核心组件**：\n",
    "- **Planner**：分解研究话题\n",
    "- **Tools**：web_search, read_page, store_note, search_memory\n",
    "- **Memory**：长期记忆（向量库）\n",
    "- **Observer**：轨迹记录 + eval\n",
    "\n",
    **工作流程**：\n",
    "1. 输入话题 → Planner 分解成 3-5 个子问题\n",
    "2. 每个 子问题 → Tools 搜资料 → read_page 读取内容\n",
    "3. 存储到笔记 + 向量库（长期记忆）\n",
    "4. 检查 checkpoint → 失败则重试\n",
    "5. 总结综述 → store_note\n",
    "6. 所有阶段记录 → Observer eval"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "s1-c1",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# OFFLINE：模拟 Agent 架构\n",
    "\n",
    "class ResearchAgent:\n",
    "    def __init__(self):\n",
    "        self.tools = ['web_search', 'read_page', 'store_note', 'search_memory']\n",
    "        self.memory = []  # 长期记忆\n",
    "        self.checkpoint = {}\n",
    "        self.observer = []  # 轨迹记录\n",
    "    \n",
    "    def planner(self, topic):\n",
    "        \"\"\"分解研究话题\"\"\"\n",
    "        sub_questions = [\n",
    "            f'什么是 {topic}？',\n",
    "            f'{topic} 的关键论文有哪些？',\n",
    "            f'{topic} 的最新进展是什么？',\n",
    "            f'{topic} 的挑战和未来方向'\n",
    "        ]\n",
    "        return sub_questions\n",
    "    \n",
    "    def web_search(self, query):\n",
    "        \"\"\"模拟 web 搜索\"\"\"\n",
    "        return [\n",
    "            {'title': f'论文 {i}', 'url': f'http://example.com/{i}', 'snippet': f'这是关于 {query} 的搜索结果'}\n",
    "            for i in range(1, 4)\n",
    "        ]\n",
    "    \n",
    "    def read_page(self, url):\n",
    "        \"\"\"模拟读取页面\"\"\"\n",
    "        return f'[页面内容] {url}: ...这是文章的详细内容...' + ('...' * 200)\n",
    "    \n",
    "    def store_note(self, content, tags):\n",
    "        \"\"\"存储笔记到长期记忆\"\"\"\n",
    "        note = {\n",
    "            'id': int(hashlib.md5(content.encode()).hexdigest()[:8], 16),\n",
    "            'content': content,\n",
    "            'tags': tags,\n",
    "            'timestamp': time.strftime('%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%SZ')\n",
    "        }\n",
    "        self.memory.append(note)\n",
    "        return note['id']\n",
    "    \n",
    "    def search_memory(self, query, top_k=5):\n",
    "        \"\"\"搜索长期记忆\"\"\"\n",
    "        return [n for n in self.memory if any(q in n['content'] for q in query.split())][:top_k]\n",
    "    \n",
    "    def run(self, topic):\n",
    "        \"\"\"运行完整研究流程\"\"\"\n",
    "        self.observer.append({'start': time.time(), 'topic': topic})\n",
    "        \n",
    "        # 1. 分解话题\n",
    "        sub_questions = self.planner(topic)\n",
    "        print(f'主题分解: {len(sub_questions)} 个子问题')\n",
    "        \n",
    "        # 2. 对每个子问题搜资料\n",
    "        for i, question in enumerate(sub_questions):\n",
    "            print(f'\\n[{i+1}/{len(sub_questions)}] 处理: {question}')\n",
    "            \n",
    "            self.observer.append({'step': i, 'type': 'search', 'query': question, 'start': time.time()})\n",
    "            results = self.web_search(question)\n",
    "            print(f'  找到 {len(results)} 个结果')\n",
    "            \n",
    "            # 读取每个结果\n",
    "            for j, result in enumerate(results):\n",
    "                print(f'  [{j+1}/{len(results)}] 读取: {result[\"title\"]}')\n",
    "                content = self.read_page(result['url'])\n",
    "                # 存储笔记\n",
    "                note_id = self.store_note(content, [question, topic])\n",
    "                print(f'    存储笔记: ID={note_id}')\n",
    "            \n",
    "            self.observer[-1]['end'] = time.time()\n",
    "        \n",
    "        # 3. 搜索长期记忆\n",
    "        print(f'\\n搜索长期记忆...')\n",
    "        memories = self.search_memory(topic)\n",
    "        print(f'找到 {len(memories)} 条相关笔记')\n",
    "        \n",
    "        self.observer.append({'end': time.time(), 'type': 'done'})\n",
    "        \n",
    "        return {\n",
    "            'topic': topic,\n",
    "            'sub_questions': sub_questions,\n",
    "            'note_count': len(self.memory),\n",
    "            'memory_used': len(memories)\n",
    "        }\n",
    "\n",
    "print('=== ResearchAgent 架构（模拟）===')\n",
    "agent = ResearchAgent()\n",
    "result = agent.run('RAG 评估的最新进展')\n",
    "print(f'\\n=== 执行结果 ===')\n",
    "print(f'主题: {result[\"topic\"]}')\n",
    "print(f'子问题: {result[\"sub_questions\"]}')\n",
    "print(f'笔记数量: {result[\"note_count\"]}')\n",
    "print(f'记忆使用: {result[\"memory_used\"]}')"
   ]
  },
