    **Skill 文件**：\n",
    "```\n",
    "~/.claude/skills/research-topic/\n",
    "  SKILL.md\n",
    "  README.md\n",
    "  examples/\n",
    "    topic1.json\n",
    "    topic2.json\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
