    "## 5. 轨迹评估与 Skill 改进\n",
    "\n",
    **评估指标**：\n",
    "- 成功率：成功子问题数 / 总数\n",
    "- 平均耗时：每个子问题的平均时间\n",
    "- 评估问题：轨迹 eval（LLM-as-judge）\n",
    "\n",
    **改进策略**：\n",
    "- checkpoint 太多 → 减少子问题数量\n",
    "- web_search 失败 → 增加重试次数\n",
    "- 轨迹eval 差 → 优化工具调用顺序"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "s5-c1",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# OFFLINE：模拟轨迹评估\n",
    "\n",
    "def simulate_trajectory_eval(scenario):\n",
    "    \"\"\"模拟轨迹评估（LLM-as-judge）\"\"\"\n",
    "    print(f'=== {scenario} 轨迹评估 ===')\n",
    "    \n",
    "    eval_metrics = {\n",
    "        'Success Rate': 0.0,\n",
    "        'Avg Duration (s)': 0.0,\n",
    "        'Note Quality': 0.0,\n",
    "        'Summary Coherence': 0.0\n",
    "    }\n",
    "    \n",
    "    if scenario == 'ideal':\n",
    "        eval_metrics = {\n",
    "            'Success Rate': 1.0,\n",
    "            'Avg Duration (s)': 45.2,\n",
    "            'Note Quality': 4.5,\n",
    "            'Summary Coherence': 4.3\n",
    "        }\n",
    "    elif scenario == 'failed':\n",
    "        eval_metrics = {\n",
    "            'Success Rate': 0.4,\n",
    "            'Avg Duration (s)': 120.5,\n",
    "            'Note Quality': 2.1,\n",
    "            'Summary Coherence': 2.8\n",
    "        }\n",
    "    elif scenario == 'partial':\n",
    "        eval_metrics = {\n",
    "            'Success Rate': 0.7,\n",
    "            'Avg Duration (s)': 67.3,\n",
    "            'Note Quality': 3.8,\n",
    "            'Summary Coherence': 3.5\n",
    "        }\n",
    "    \n",
    "    for metric, value in eval_metrics.items():\n",
    "        print(f'  {metric:20s}: {value}')\n",
    "    \n",
    "    return eval_metrics\n",
    "\n",
    "print('=== 理想场景 ===')\n",
    "ideal = simulate_trajectory_eval('ideal')\n",
    "\n",
    "print('\\n=== 失败场景 ===')\n",
    "failed = simulate_trajectory_eval('failed')\n",
    "\n",
    "print('\\n=== 部分成功 ===')\n",
    "partial = simulate_trajectory_eval('partial')\n",
    "\n",
    "print('\\n=== 改进建议 ===')\n",
    "print('理想 → 部分成功: checkpoint 太少，可以考虑拆分更多子问题')\n",
    "print('失败 → 理想: 增加重试、优化工具顺序、增加检查点')"
   ]
